  "title": {
    "en": "Video & Image Generation (curated)",
    "zh": "视频 / 图像生成精选"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "A hand-curated DSH market containing only video- and image-generation plugins. Every version is pinned to a fixed Git commit. Entries are sorted by GitHub stars, and each one carries a 'free' or 'byok' label: 'free' means the plugin installs and runs without a paid subscription (local engine, self-hosted backend, or a provider's free tier), 'byok' means you must supply your own paid API key. Third-party content — review before installing.",
    "zh": "手工维护的 DSH 插件市场，只收录视频与图像生成类插件。每个版本都锁定到具体的 Git 提交，按 GitHub 星标排序，并标注「free（免费）」或「byok（需自备 Key）」：free 表示安装后无需付费订阅即可运行（本地引擎、自建后端或厂商免费额度），byok 表示必须自备付费 API Key。第三方内容，安装前请自行确认。"
  },
